{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t教育局局長蔡若蓮表示，洪水橋大學城三幅校園區用地，每幅均有院校感興趣，政府會綜合考慮院校的學術科研實力、發展計劃及財政能力。<br/>\n<br/>\n她又預計，院校申請的貸款總額有機會超出政府預留的100億元，日後將因應實際需要爭取「加碼」。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：詹可揚\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:09:14.147801+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:35:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:13:56.033523+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:02:50.506083+00:00","content_hash":"9300f23efb8ffde6afd56195b0dd5dc09a88cb6904cc3b3f1cfe65f01373d461","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}